", "id": "1148192932456664", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974625_1148192935789997_1416656799652225989_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ZlkWQflaj8Q7kNvwEqiBkp&_nc_oc=AdqW9dXRjAXmfgwuOTrhoTSrwnPyAkExyTFcMnvs3mPBPkH590H8Mbo6QIG-etUSCiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6TzJF7XblYUxVDAhlVkCqHi48xQbXV1quSd1LIg5vg_Q&oe=69FC96B6"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-2.png", "id": "2332569856899945", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_2332569860233278_8835659424562109361_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gLZ3cSWiO1kQ7kNvwFpzrhJ&_nc_oc=AdohC-1f3SpVm1DVqNaAIu9vbHnevB1Ami3UV6qUgHbD_jVrs8OgsuhIrwMRyeHrA8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WF8CscbBv5eONp33KKCa-8pmgWvUqxvMy3nNGQ1KFvA&oe=69FCA676"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-5.png", "id": "430728135872291", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003247_430728139205624_5946641524650245644_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QpwXoPqsAoUQ7kNvwFM6r5o&_nc_oc=Adp1IquaWehSkUQqPoaiDdcnEqhtQ-74FUYvgpD96ZjA_oWq5CH65RR3_ZYyiKB4Vjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4_ZMLTTDD86eQ0ezuJ_k9xguz9yeefAwGvdZnJtgyZwQ&oe=69FCA8A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videoscreen.png", "id": "986130542781323", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974594_986130546114656_4585000279316381076_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3vKKco6I8jEQ7kNvwGarJw5&_nc_oc=AdpZ8GldR93iQWj9D6nw0RXy6dZ11pUqHMv7YTN0ozOmMOcyjz0rzAg_sKkhLOFGOok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4h7cd6HNG26I2HJDuIE45AqYZLp10HmyLPDgews1fyvQ&oe=69FC9A2E"}, "display_name": "Paradiddle", "keywords": ["drum", "beat", "music", "piano", "instrument"], "long_description": "So much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!\n\nKey Features:\n- Flex your skills in the built-in rhythm game mode: adjustable difficulty for 30 different songs, plus custom song support and cross-platform leaderboards.\n- Create your custom drum kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments, from mallet instruments like the xylophone and steel drum, to auxiliary percussion such as bongos, tambourines and timpanis.\n- Pick up the basics with 10 beginner-friendly lessons, perfect for drumming newcomers.\n- Use the new multiplayer mode to perform for your friends in free play, or compete to get the high score playing the built-in songs.\n- MR passthrough support empowers you to play virtual drums in the real world. You can even connect and augment your physical kit with the rhythm game mode and lessons.\n- MIDI input/output support provides a powerful tool for composers, and also lets you augment your own electronic drum kit.\n- Set the mood with 4 different environments: Dojo, Jazz Club, Galaxy, Void.\n- USB and Bluetooth pedal support for kick and hi-hat.\n- Load your own songs, audio files and sheet music.\n- Easily save/load different kits and record your jam sessions.", "short_description": "Play drums without the limitations of the real world.\n\nSo much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emre Tanirgan", "support_website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/faq", "website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/